From bee8819072ab5f411d82672ba50c8881e1b5f610 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HibernalGlow <3090253564@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:38:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] desktop: ship the shell under the Xaihi name

The packaged identity still read DeepSeek Harness: productName, the artifact filename prefix, the URL-protocol display name, the microphone usage string, the NSIS extraction-failure text, and the two CLI shims that find the executable by name inside the installed bundle. This build is called Xaihi, so every shipped surface says Xaihi. The npm scope, the dsh URL scheme and the Software\DeepSeekHarness registry keys stay: those are install and OS identity, not display names.
